# Copy to .env (gitignored -- never commit real values) next to this file,
# fill in what you need. Same variables deploy/start-server.sh documents
# for the native path; none are required just to start the server -- see
# main.ts's own startup-log warnings for what each missing one degrades.

# ExitPlanMode design-check extraction. Without this (or the Bedrock
# alternative below), those checks fail soft to "clean" -- the core
# Edit/Write "you need a registered design" check still works either way.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Alternative to OPENROUTER_API_KEY: route extraction through Bedrock
# instead. If set, needs AWS credentials below too.
# TWING_EXTRACT_PROVIDER=bedrock

# The async semantic-conflict comparator always calls Bedrock regardless of
# TWING_EXTRACT_PROVIDER -- without these, that specific check fails soft
# to "no conflict" rather than failing the server.
AWS_BEARER_TOKEN_BEDROCK=
AWS_REGION=
